bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=18][b]🎯 Goal[/b][/font_size]
Survive all 6 days. Each day lasts 90 seconds. Complete the house's daily Water, Food and Energy tasks and keep your resources above their targets.

[font_size=18][b]⚡ Actions & daily targets[/b][/font_size]
You have 5 actions each day. Most activities cost 1 action, so plan carefully. At day's end, keep at least [img=18x18]res://assets/ui_icons/water_icon.png[/img] 35, [img=18x18]res://assets/ui_icons/wheat_icon.png[/img] 30, [img=18x18]res://assets/ui_icons/energy_icon.png[/img] 30 and [img=18x18]res://assets/ui_icons/leafy_vegetable_icon.png[/img] 40. Falling short or missing a main task costs a heart.

[font_size=18][b]🌱 Gather & grow[/b][/font_size]
[img=20x20]res://assets/ui_icons/water_icon.png[/img] Well: once a day, get +12 water and lose 5 Nature. Unlock the tank to raise daily water renewal from +2 to +6.
[img=20x20]res://assets/ui_icons/wheat_icon.png[/img] Pond: fish once for +8 Food and -1 Nature, or clean once for +7 Nature and a flower.
[img=20x20]res://assets/ui_icons/leafy_vegetable_icon.png[/img] Farm: irrigate, wait, then harvest. Basic is faster and yields more; drip/eco uses fewer resources but yields less.
Plant one tree each day: spend 5 Water and gain 6 Nature, then +4 more when it matures. Compost and recycling also help restore Nature.

[font_size=18][b]🔋 Energy & events[/b][/font_size]
Collect energy at the power plant once per day. Solar costs 2 actions to unlock and prevents the old plant's daily Nature loss. Crises appear during the day; responding costs an action but may reduce damage or earn a flower."
fit_content = true
scroll_active = false

